Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.78,0:00:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we get superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.18,0:00:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we get superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.00,0:00:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.72,0:00:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we get superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.46,0:00:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.18,0:00:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we get superpowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.26,0:00:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a monster deep within your dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.72,0:00:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Taking aim for your\Nheart so it would seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.46,0:00:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand tall and read, go to\Nhell and jump for paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.50,0:00:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time dangerous, dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.46,0:00:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,We like it serious, serious, oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.08,0:00:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Looking deep in the dream\Nthere is the one in pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.66,0:00:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Turns out that's the one who\Nmeans the most to you today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.06,0:00:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Adventure calls now, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.62,0:00:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,The balls built between\Nus, they will show.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.30,0:00:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Still what we don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.64,0:00:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, working hard together.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.02,0:01:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we've got superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.00,0:01:04.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Got to dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.54,0:01:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite the rivalry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.80,0:01:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta see it through.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.14,0:01:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Believing in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.54,0:01:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,There's even charm in failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.12,0:01:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we've got superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.48,0:01:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,All the love and the tears.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.42,0:01:19.71,Default,,0,0,0,,In the world we're in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.08,0:01:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,United gently bringing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.88,0:01:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Our thought again, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.90,0:01:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We're the foolish ones we love.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.42,0:01:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll carry on till we see the light.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.86,0:01:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,The sun will rise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.26,0:01:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The greatest fight at its core.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.02,0:01:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Is against myself forevermore.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.86,0:01:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, let's do it now, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.50,0:01:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The balls filled between\Nus, they will show.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.08,0:01:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,So what we don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.38,0:01:51.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what we call adventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.04,0:01:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we've got superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.78,0:01:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Got to dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.34,0:01:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite the rivalry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.56,0:01:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta see it through.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.96,0:02:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Believing in you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.34,0:02:02.90,Default,,0,0,0,,There's even charm in failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.98,0:02:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we've got superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.40,0:02:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we've got superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.62,0:02:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we've got superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.22,0:02:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we've got
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.58,0:02:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,superpowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.08,0:02:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, we're the Super Bowers!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.32,0:02:55.56,Default,,0,0,0,,How else would Straw Hat be\Nusing your ability, stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.38,0:03:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, this mirror is the key\Nfor the allied forces to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.56,0:03:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,And when I fulfill this task,\NI can get my heart back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.70,0:03:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I'm squared away, it's\Npayback time for Caesar.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.56,0:03:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder how everything is going.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.12,0:03:27.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't hear Big Mom's quack.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.72,0:03:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What's keeping the old bag?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.88,0:03:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,So far, so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.20,0:03:37.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The cake's everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.44,0:03:40.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The feral gaggle of straw\Nhats are amassing chaos.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.32,0:03:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother Carmel's picture is shattered.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.44,0:03:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, why hasn't\Nshe blown a gasket yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.54,0:03:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What could be the holdup?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.92,0:04:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy, wait. Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.86,0:04:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Tread carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.72,0:04:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Mom is having an emotional\Noverload and can't focus,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.90,0:04:11.62,Default,,0,0,0,,so we must show her the\Npicture again. Sure!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.94,0:04:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,If you say so, that's what we'll do!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.90,0:04:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Just leave it to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.42,0:04:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.94,0:04:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let him get near Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.20,0:04:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you sabotaging us?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.52,0:04:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Veggie!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.02,0:04:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You two-faced bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.72,0:04:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Need lead, Katakuri.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.20,0:05:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so mad!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.76,0:05:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You traitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.98,0:05:08.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew that you would turn on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.18,0:05:14.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Press. Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.70,0:05:17.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and slaughter them already.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.16,0:05:19.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm getting to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.00,0:05:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,So impatient.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.40,0:05:26.22,Default,,0,0,0,,My brother wants me to\Nwrap this up lickety-split.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.30,0:05:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He gets antsy since he sees the future,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.66,0:05:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,but he's not the only one who\Nknows what will happen this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.58,0:05:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Considering that you're\Ncurrently trapped in candy,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.46,0:05:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,you'll die frozen here\Nin place, tears and all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.06,0:05:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Coo-coo-coo, there's no other outcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.28,0:05:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You bastard, if I had my raid suit, then\Nwe would be the ones laughing at you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.66,0:05:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.66,0:05:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,A weapon?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.94,0:05:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you think that would help?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.64,0:05:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think so
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.00,0:06:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,How sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.38,0:06:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You tried to sneak a weapon into your\Nown son's wedding and got caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.44,0:06:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave now, Reiju!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.62,0:06:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Great, it's you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.34,0:06:27.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't get in my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.90,0:06:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,That jackass.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.46,0:06:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,What is he doing anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.32,0:06:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Sticking his nose in our mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.16,0:06:53.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.52,0:06:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I underestimated your kind nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.98,0:07:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Even now you won't abandon us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.58,0:07:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Despite our rejection of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.00,0:07:07.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I've lived my entire life in shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.48,0:07:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I was a fin smoke, however.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.08,0:07:20.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Seeing you all grown up\Ni feel a sense of peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.52,0:07:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,A conscience still remains\Nin our family's bloodline.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.38,0:07:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.40,0:07:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.98,0:07:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,His family needs help.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.98,0:08:11.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let it touch you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.52,0:08:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.56,0:08:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Pedro!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.48,0:08:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Now 5,000 brick fish!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.76,0:08:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.56,0:08:29.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Veggie!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.46,0:08:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,She ain't held, Katakuri!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.66,0:08:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Not so fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.62,0:09:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.18,0:09:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.12,0:09:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.02,0:09:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.86,0:09:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.86,0:09:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.86,0:09:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Showtime!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.88,0:10:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.40,0:10:51.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.58,0:11:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.30,0:11:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, I know you can't hear me, but we're\Ngoing to leave the rest up to you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.18,0:12:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Mama, she's hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.78,0:12:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.24,0:12:18.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Somebody!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.18,0:12:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to stop Veggie and this man!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.86,0:12:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.78,0:12:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You traitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.34,0:12:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.86,0:12:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll pay for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.44,0:12:31.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Big Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.72,0:12:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,She in hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.68,0:12:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.92,0:12:43.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, answer me, mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.26,0:12:46.44,Default,,0,0,0,,No one listens.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.12,0:12:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,They don't want to hear\Nwhat I have to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.34,0:12:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, mother, where did you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.98,0:12:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Her feelings overflow.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.80,0:13:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The memories that bring\Nforth these tears began
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.78,0:13:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,63 years ago on an\Nisland in the New World.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.44,0:13:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a kingdom inhabited by giants.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.68,0:13:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,the home of the warriors of Elbaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.14,0:13:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Now come along, sweetie.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.36,0:13:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.26,0:13:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you all about this place later.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.58,0:13:39.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you come on down, Lin-Lin?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.40,0:13:42.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.31,0:13:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.04,0:13:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.88,0:13:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This is new!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.54,0:13:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,So what are we doing here, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.42,0:13:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Daddy has an important\Njob on a nearby island.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.34,0:14:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Lin-Lin, will you be a good\Ngirl and wait for us here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.28,0:14:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Aww!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.19,0:14:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to go, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.64,0:14:06.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What if I told you you could have all the\Ntreats in your bag while you stay put?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.54,0:14:07.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.45,0:14:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What daddy said.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.66,0:14:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.84,0:14:10.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, love, love.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.86,0:14:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wait, right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.22,0:14:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Take your time. OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.98,0:14:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Bye-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.36,0:14:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be right here when you get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.58,0:14:27.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It's OK, honey. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.60,0:14:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,After all the damage she's caused,\Nwe're lucky it's just deportation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.44,0:14:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,She's far too much for us to handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.22,0:14:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,They say the Holy Mother lives here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.78,0:14:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I just know she'll save Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.16,0:14:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to head out!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.70,0:14:43.70,Default,,0,0,0,,This island is dangerous as hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.70,0:14:53.24,Default,,0,0,0,,See you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.84,0:14:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.75,0:15:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What big fishies those are!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.46,0:15:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,This is weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.98,0:15:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,When are they coming back?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.20,0:15:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm getting really hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.34,0:15:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, mama, papa, where did you both go?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.84,0:15:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,It's taking you so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.22,0:15:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,In regards to Elbath,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.18,0:15:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,it was once home to giant warriors\Nwho struck fear into the heart of the.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.00,0:15:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,world a century ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.48,0:15:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,They were known as the Giant Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.82,0:15:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,These ruthless titans wreaked
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.56,0:15:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,havoc on the seas and land alike,\Ndestroying everything in their path.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.38,0:15:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.29,0:15:50.45,Default,,0,0,0,,their reign of terror\Nabruptly ended when the two
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.54,0:15:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,captains of the Giant Pirates\Nsuddenly vanished one day
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.60,0:15:56.56,Default,,0,0,0,,and passed into legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.64,0:15:59.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Directionists, after the\Nloss of their leaders,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.12,0:16:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,the remaining stragglers\NOf their crew were
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.08,0:16:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,rounded up by the navy and\Nsentenced to execution.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.02,0:16:08.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.62,0:16:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,a
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.88,0:16:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.26,0:16:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Halt the execution!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.34,0:16:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Heaven requires forgiveness, not wrath.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.58,0:16:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Unexpectedly, a beautiful\Nwandering woman appeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.58,0:16:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Her name was Sister Carmel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.32,0:16:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Why show them mercy?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.00,0:16:37.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you not realize how much terror\Nthese nuisances have caused us?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.30,0:16:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Even more reason then?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.82,0:16:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can't you see that
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.88,0:16:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,if you kill those men the warriors\Nof Albac will seek vengeance?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.52,0:16:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You would be endangering all of humankind.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.72,0:17:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, forgive their sins.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.38,0:17:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I vow to show them the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.66,0:17:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I will guide them to a brighter world,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.60,0:17:24.06,Default,,0,0,0,,where all people can join\Nhands and laugh together.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.42,0:17:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.52,0:17:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,She came to be known as Mother Carmel\Nand founded the House of Lambs.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.80,0:17:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,an orphanage that took in children\Nwith no other place to go,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.06,0:17:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,regardless of their race or class.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.74,0:17:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Settling in the homeland\Nof these colossal beings,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.46,0:17:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,she also worked as a diplomatic bridge\Nbetween giant kind and humanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.76,0:17:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And then, 37 years later...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.10,0:17:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You're in good hands now, Lin-Lin.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.86,0:17:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take perfect care of you until\Nyour mommy and daddy return here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.00,0:18:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,They ain't coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.40,0:18:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You're never gonna leave us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.66,0:18:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll find that the children\Nhere are rather unique.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.82,0:18:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, unique enough to dump.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.54,0:18:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll fit in quite nicely.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.30,0:18:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh. Thanks, lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.48,0:18:17.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You got anything to eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.42,0:18:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a big one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.90,0:18:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you a giant?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.92,0:18:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go fix you up some food, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.00,0:18:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.91,0:18:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,The orphanage inhabitants\Nincluded an exiled prince,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.02,0:18:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,an impoverished boy who was\Nnearly so old into slavery.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.94,0:18:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,and various problem children whose\Nparents were unable to control them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.88,0:18:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,They all lived a peaceful\Nlife among the giants,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.32,0:18:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,where their past could\Nnot haunt them any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.54,0:18:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mother!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.30,0:18:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's the new girl? Huh? Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.02,0:18:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But most important of all,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.32,0:18:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,for a child who is always\Nbigger than everyone around her,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.60,0:18:56.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The land of Elbaf was the first place\NLin-Lin had ever seen where the people,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.54,0:18:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,houses, and everything else fit her size.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.58,0:19:01.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a comforting place for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.28,0:19:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Wowie!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.19,0:19:06.38,Default,,0,0,0,,So cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.86,0:19:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.48,0:19:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.92,0:19:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, what's the matter, Lin-Lin, dear?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.74,0:19:27.40,Default,,0,0,0,,A bear and a wolf were being\Nmean to each other in the forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.74,0:19:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I was only trying to\Ntell them it's not nice
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.62,0:19:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,to fight and that they should be friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.54,0:19:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,So I put them in the same cage\Nso they could make up. But Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.48,0:19:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Bear must have gotten\Nhungry and ate Mr. Wolf.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.86,0:19:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,So I smacked him for being bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.34,0:19:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.25,0:19:45.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Bear looks sorry to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.52,0:19:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,How much did you hit him?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.86,0:19:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Just one time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.32,0:19:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,She killed the bear with a single blow.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.00,0:20:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, what a sweetie you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.76,0:20:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You only wanted those two to\Nbecome friends, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.10,0:20:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You're such a kind-hearted girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.94,0:20:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.56,0:20:15.56,Default,,0,0,0,,How about we go find the\Nother kids so we can play?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.10,0:20:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.44,0:20:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,For the first time in Lin-Lin's\Nlife, someone finally understood her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.82,0:20:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.18,0:20:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Lin-Lin killed a bear with only one punch!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.98,0:20:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That girl's way scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.16,0:20:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.58,0:20:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Barry the Giant's hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.54,0:20:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,She tried to smack a\Nmosquito off of the poor guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.36,0:20:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,We heard a bunch of his bones go snap!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.38,0:20:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Knock it off!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.54,0:20:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What'd you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.08,0:20:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Lin-Lin! Yes, Mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.80,0:20:51.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, she's hurting me!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.76,0:20:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you ever notice he has an extra elbow?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.40,0:20:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought it'd be nice to\Nstraighten it out for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.06,0:20:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,No, don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.97,0:20:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,He's from the Longarm tribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.22,0:21:00.57,Default,,0,0,0,,That's natural for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.42,0:21:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.34,0:21:07.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Lin-Lin, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.68,0:21:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.92,0:21:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,He's got weird fins, so I thought\NI'd help by tearing him off.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.66,0:21:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Sweetheart, please stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.02,0:21:14.85,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a fish man.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.93,0:21:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It's normal for him to have fish parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.08,0:21:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.54,0:21:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I was so scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.48,0:21:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, please forgive her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.72,0:21:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Lin-Lin always means well.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.10,0:21:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother Carmel always preached forgiveness.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.14,0:21:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.08,0:21:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Lin-Lin's gonna get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.06,0:21:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop running away!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.38,0:21:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,After 10 months of residing in\Nthe mighty country of Elbaf,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.36,0:22:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,the warriors of the land\Naccepted Lin-Lin with open arms.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.80,0:22:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you believe it's been 40 years?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.06,0:22:11.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Ever heard of a duel lasting that long?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.34,0:22:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't say that I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.12,0:22:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go pick him up after\Nanother decade or so.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.72,0:22:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Lin-Lin!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.18,0:22:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Time's running out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.48,0:22:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You finished getting ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.56,0:22:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Buddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.47,0:22:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean, Kashi?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.76,0:22:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I almost forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.42,0:22:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Your first time, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.46,0:22:38.23,Default,,0,0,0,,In Elbaf, we fast for 12 days straight\Nright before the Winter Solstice Festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.56,0:22:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What's fast mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.14,0:22:41.72,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't eat any food.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.80,0:22:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, the only thing\Nwe can drink is water.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.46,0:22:45.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gonna start tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.20,0:22:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'll be so hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.48,0:22:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but once it's all\Ndone, we'll have a big feast!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.74,0:23:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Your true opponents, yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.50,0:23:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Now stand up, Hiradine.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.46,0:23:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,This giant boy, Hyrodine,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.58,0:23:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,grew up to be one of the Coliseum fighters\NLuffy faced off against in Dressrosa.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.82,0:23:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,However, they weren't enemies for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.00,0:23:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He, along with the other\NGrateful Gladiators,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.62,0:23:27.16,Default,,0,0,0,,pledged allegiance to\NLuffy over a cup of sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.24,0:23:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He is now a proud member\Nof the Straw Hat fleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.04,0:23:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,He's so tough! Ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.12,0:23:35.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.03,0:23:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,either Chief Dory or Chief Brogy will\Nreturn to revive the giant pirate crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.00,0:23:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be prepared for when that\Nday finally arrives you're a warrior.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.88,0:23:46.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hone your skills. Hardeen
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.72,0:24:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief Beardfall, Chief\NBeardhill. I know Carmel
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.36,0:24:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,preaches trade over plunder\NThat's well and good.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.54,0:24:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But we are still warriors above all else.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.32,0:24:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't let our blades dull. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.04,0:24:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I understand, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.88,0:24:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.48,0:24:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,No wonder why all the giants\Nlook up to our chiefs.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.90,0:24:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to be a great warrior\Nlike them when I grow up.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.30,0:24:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,And to what do we owe the\Nhonor of your visit today?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.48,0:24:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,We're here to eat Semla in the village and
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.42,0:24:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,to fetch the children\Nat the House of Lambs.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.92,0:24:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you care to join us, Lin-Lin?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.04,0:24:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What's a semla?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.94,0:24:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a sweet and delicious\Ntreat! Yeah? Give me some!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.70,0:24:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Before the big fast, we get lots\Nof nutrition by eating semla!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.44,0:24:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's yummy like a candy or cake?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.78,0:24:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,And we're gonna eat it right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.48,0:24:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.42,0:24:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a tasty cream dolloped and a dessert.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.98,0:24:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,bread with marzipan topped\Nwith powdered sugar!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.20,0:25:00.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the best. Before the fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.94,0:25:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's awesome. Haven't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.00,0:25:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,May the feast commence.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.20,0:25:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us celebrate the recent\Nbirth of Prince Loki.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.04,0:25:17.16,Default,,0,0,0,,And also, let's raise a barrel to the\Nvillage newborns Rodo and Goldberg.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.46,0:25:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We praise the sun above.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.30,0:25:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,May it shine over them warmly.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.44,0:25:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,To the sun!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.72,0:25:25.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for the food, sun!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.44,0:25:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Simla!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.52,0:25:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We have plenty, so don't hold back.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.38,0:25:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.29,0:25:35.12,Default,,0,0,0,,so...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.21,0:25:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's sweet!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.40,0:25:39.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that's yummy!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.58,0:25:40.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.06,0:26:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, Midland, slow down!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.32,0:26:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You need to save some for the other kids\Nor there won't be enough to go around.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.28,0:26:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Take your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.30,0:26:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You must show the sun some gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.08,0:26:10.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You are similar!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.70,0:26:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, God!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.76,0:26:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.16,0:26:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I love you, similar!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.50,0:26:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.76,0:26:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel like I'm gonna starve and die.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.04,0:26:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The Winter Solstice Festival\Ncelebrates the sun's death rebirth
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.82,0:26:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,you must be strong after a\Nharsh winter it will regain its
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.22,0:26:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,strength and shine down on us\Nagain the more that we suffer
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.40,0:26:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The deeper our gratitude to the\Nsun becomes, fortitude hang in
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.70,0:26:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,There, kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.61,0:27:01.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if Mother says so,\Nthen I'll keep at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.08,0:27:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm losing weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.28,0:27:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You really
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.48,0:27:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,aren't.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.39,0:27:07.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.80,0:27:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm withering away.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.34,0:27:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Linlin, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.25,0:27:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You're doing wonderfully.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.18,0:27:13.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a little more to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.66,0:27:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Lin-Lin had really taken\Na liking to Mother Carmel.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.54,0:27:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.02,0:27:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I want some more, some more.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.38,0:27:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.36,0:27:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,wanna eat it... again.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.78,0:27:45.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother, help!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.06,0:27:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, the trouble!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.96,0:27:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened, Carrot dear?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.80,0:27:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Lin-Lin's crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.52,0:28:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.86,0:28:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.22,0:28:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Lin-Lin!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.60,0:28:17.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Give it to me right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.22,0:28:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.90,0:28:27.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The village of Elpa was\Ndestroyed by that girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.70,0:28:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a nightmare!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.08,0:28:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You've made a dire mistake lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.06,0:28:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What right do you have to thank the sun?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.76,0:28:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Even a child can only be forgiven so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.86,0:28:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief, your rule!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.54,0:28:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me Samba!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.00,0:28:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Poor Samba!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.48,0:28:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother Carmen, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.82,0:28:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That is no little girl standing\Nbefore us. Don't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.76,0:28:52.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Chief, your rule!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.76,0:28:54.80,Default,,0,0,0,,She's a god of disaster!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.28,0:29:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Samba!
